    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n15 hours ago After having lost a blowout in their previous game against Sacred Heart, East Grand Forks was happy to have turned things around on Tuesday. They put the hurt on the Bemidji Lumberjacks with a sharp 3-0 victory. This was payback for the Green Wave, who suffered a 3-1 defeat the last time these two teams met. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
